<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2b1559-en-882315c3" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>乱世四大文豪合集注译OCR _ 陶渊明集, 嵇康集, 阮籍集, 曹操集，p.683ff</title><editor role="translator">Zhang Guixi 張桂喜</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>乱世四大文豪合集注译OCR _ 陶渊明集, 嵇康集, 阮籍集, 曹操集，p.683ff</title>长沙：湖南文艺出版社，1996</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2b1559"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-06-10T04:52:38.937+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2b1559-start"><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:54:56.955+09:00">有秦客问东野主人说.：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:55:05.761+09:00">我听前人论述说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:55:20.395+09:00">"太平时世的音乐安详而且快乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:55:31.093+09:00">亡国之音悲哀而且忧伤」</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:55:40.057+09:00">国家的治乱出于政事，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:55:55.6+09:00">音乐却能与此应和，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:56:03.449+09:00">所以悲哀忧伤之情</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:56:23.646+09:00">表现于钟磬鼓乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:10:51.929+09:00">安详和乐之象</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:57:54.868+09:00">书写于丝竹管弦。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:58:09.938+09:00">再说：孔子听《貂》，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:58:21.368+09:00">能认识到虞舜的德行，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:58:44.255+09:00">季札听"风雅"，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:58:56.439+09:00">知道是不同国家的民谣。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:59:05.976+09:00">这是已熟有的历史事实，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:59:39.777+09:00">古圣先价所不怀疑。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T04:59:55.475+09:00">现在你偏偏认为，音乐本身没有哀乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:00:10.444+09:00">理由悬什么？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:00:19.745+09:00">如果有高论，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:00:25.796+09:00">请讲给我听听。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:11:23.468+09:00">东哥主人回答道：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:11:41.945+09:00">对音乐的理解长久以来停滞不前，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:11:54.843+09:00">没有人肯加以改变和发展，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:12:08.705+09:00">所以历代关于音乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:12:24.126+09:00">弄不清其名与实。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:12:39.226+09:00">现在承蒙你启发开导，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:12:47.517+09:00">我来谈一谈。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:12:57.502+09:00">天地谐合，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:13:18.853+09:00">万物因此滋生，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:13:29.208+09:00">寒来暑往，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:13:38.244+09:00">五行形成，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:14:09.347+09:00">配五色，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.35" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:14:35.659+09:00">发五声。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:14:47.063+09:00">音乐的产生形成，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.37" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:14:57.355+09:00">为同气味存在于天地之间，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:15:08.592+09:00">好与不好，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.39" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:15:15.092+09:00">虽遭世事变乱，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:15:35.856+09:00">其本体保持原样</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.41" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:15:41.213+09:00">而无所改变，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:15:57.228+09:00">怎么会因为人的爱憎而改变本质、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.43" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:16:12.767+09:00">因为人的哀乐而更换度量呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:16:55.529+09:00">及正按照不同的声调推列组合，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.45" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:17:10.019+09:00">使声音和谐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.46" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:17:18.282+09:00">这是人心中最渴望的境界，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.47" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:17:27.569+09:00">也是人的情感欲望的汇聚集中。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:17:33.5+09:00">古人懂得情感不可恣纵，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:17:39.665+09:00">欲望不可极端，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.50" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:17:47.601+09:00">所以按照所能实施的程度，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.51" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:17:59.982+09:00">常常加以协调节制，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.52" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:18:10.843+09:00">使悲哀不至于伤害身心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.53" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:18:27.221+09:00">使欢乐不至于无度。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.54" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:18:40.416+09:00">根据不同事物而以不同的名字指称，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.55" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:18:49.581+09:00">每种东西都有自己的名号，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.56" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:18:57.717+09:00">哭叫做哀，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.57" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:19:03.136+09:00">歌叫做乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.58" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:19:06.868+09:00">这是其中的大槪。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:21:46.582+09:00">然而能说快乐</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.60" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:21:55.946+09:00">就是钟鼓、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.61" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:22:09.481+09:00">悲哀</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.62" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:22:16.46+09:00">就是哭泣吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.63" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:22:22.902+09:00">由此说来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.64" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:22:35.592+09:00">玉帛并不是疝貌恭敬的实质，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.65" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:22:46.19+09:00">歌哭并不是欢乐悲哀的主体。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.66" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:23:06.839+09:00">何以说明这一点呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.67" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:23:15.983+09:00">地方不同，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.68" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:24:15.547+09:00">风俗各异，歌哭的方式也不一样，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.69" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:25:15.673+09:00">如果错开使用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.70" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:25:33.204+09:00">有的地方的人听到哭泣就快乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.71" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:25:48.228+09:00">听到歌唱就会悲哀，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.72" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:25:54.071+09:00">然而悲哀和快乐的情感却是相同的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.73" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:26:09.986+09:00">现在用同样的情感，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.74" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:26:16.834+09:00">却可能用各种不同的声音表现，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.75" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T05:26:20.672+09:00">这不是表明音乐的声音并没有确定的感情色彩吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.76" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:17:43.687+09:00">但是声音和谐地组合起来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.77" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:17:52.026+09:00">是感人最深的东西。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.78" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:17:58.051+09:00">劳动者歌唱劳动，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.79" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:18:03.53+09:00">欢乐者用舞蹈表现功绩，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.80" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:18:09.462+09:00">内心有悲怆伤痛之感，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.81" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:18:33.628+09:00">就激发哀切的言辞，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.82" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:18:39.895+09:00">言辞组成诗篇，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.83" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:18:51.367+09:00">声音构成音乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.84" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:18:58.881+09:00">错杂起来加以吟咏，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.85" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:19:04.51+09:00">聚集起来加以聆听，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.86" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:19:24.456+09:00">和谐之声感动心灵，、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.87" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:19:31.342+09:00">悲苦之言感染情绪，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.88" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:19:38.523+09:00">叹息未停，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.89" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:19:46.073+09:00">已经涕泪潸然。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.90" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:20:21.124+09:00">悲哀的情感藏于内心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.91" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:20:29.843+09:00">遇到和谐之声而后激发出来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.92" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:20:43.27+09:00">和谐之声没有具体形象，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.93" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:20:49.721+09:00">而悲哀的情感有人为主宰，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.94" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:20:55.588+09:00">以有人主宰的悲哀情感，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.95" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:21:06.575+09:00">凭借没有具体形象的和谐之声而激发表现，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.96" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:21:11.928+09:00">人们所感觉领悟到的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.97" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:21:15.965+09:00">只有悲哀而已，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.98" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:21:25.055+09:00">哪里还会想到庄子说的"风吹孔鸣音声万种，皆出于自然''的道理呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.100" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:23:30.752+09:00">风俗流行，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.101" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:23:37.87+09:00">就形成政治，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.102" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:23:43.23+09:00">所以国家的史官根据风俗明辨政教的得失，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.103" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:23:48.57+09:00">审察各地民谣的盛衰，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.104" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:23:53.875+09:00">吟咏情性，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.105" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:24:01.699+09:00">讽喻国君，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.106" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:24:09.416+09:00">所以说</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.107" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:24:15.722+09:00">"亡国之音悲哀而且忧伤"。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.108" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:24:43.326+09:00">喜、怒、哀、乐、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.109" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:24:48.667+09:00">爱、憎、惭、惧，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.110" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:24:57.809+09:00">这八种情感，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.111" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:25:43.127+09:00">是人们用来接触外物、传递自我、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.112" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:25:57.909+09:00">区别类属</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.113" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:26:03.196+09:00">而不可增减附加的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.114" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:26:12.117+09:00">味道用甜苦来指称，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.115" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:26:18.218+09:00">现在因为甲贤而心爱，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.116" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:26:24.488+09:00">因为乙愚而情憎，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.117" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:26:33.918+09:00">那么，爱憎之情属于我，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.118" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:27:00.011+09:00">贤愚之性属于他，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.119" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:27:09.086+09:00">难道可以因为我喜欢他而称之为"爱人"、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.120" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:27:16.773+09:00">我憎恶他而称之为"憎人"？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.121" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:27:27.187+09:00">所喜欢的称为"喜味"、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.122" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:27:39.152+09:00">所愤怒的称为"怒味"？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.123" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:28:02.805+09:00">由此说来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.124" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:28:08.994+09:00">外物和内心用处不同，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.125" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:28:26.536+09:00">名称不一，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.126" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:31:13.859+09:00">音乐之声自然应当以好坏为主，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.127" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:33:08.482+09:00">那就无关于哀乐。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.128" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:34:04.795+09:00">善恶与哀乐无论名和实都相去甚远，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.129" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:30:26.185+09:00">如此，声无哀乐也就显然了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.130" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:34:54.455+09:00">-</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.131" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:34:58.262+09:00">-</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.132" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:35:18.494+09:00">况且，季札在鲁国，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.133" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:35:25.078+09:00">采诗观礼，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.134" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:35:31.528+09:00">区别风雅之声，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.135" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:35:37.779+09:00">难道仅仅是单凭音乐来判断教化的好坏得失吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.136" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:36:41.331+09:00">而孔子听《韶》，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.137" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:36:52.004+09:00">赞美它尽善尽美</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.138" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:36:57.26+09:00">因此感叹，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.139" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:37:05.426+09:00">又哪里一定是凭借音乐而知道虞舜的德行，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.140" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:38:21.438+09:00">然后加以赞美呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.141" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:38:38.344+09:00">现在我粗喀地阐述音乐的一方面，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.142" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-10T06:39:35.928+09:00">也可以理解其中大半了。</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>